{"meta":{"total_count":330},"next_page":"/api/v2/latest?category=all&paginate=20&tags=products-developer-tools&fields=&site_id=2&is_main_hero=False&image_format=webp&show_hero=True&cursor=2","results":[{"page_id":85529,"headline":"We're rolling out AlphaEvolve widely to solve Google Cloud customers' hardest problems.","author":"Tom Beyer","author_list":[{"display_name":"Tom Beyer","assigned_job_title":"Group AI Product Manager, Google Cloud","image_renditions":null,"author_page":null}],"analytics_properties":{"has_carousel":"no","has_image":"no","has_audio":"no","has_video":"no","hero_media_type":"none"},"content_type":"Short Post","slug":"alphaevolve-on-cloud","tags":"google-cloud,topics-google-deepmind,products-developer-tools","secondary_tags":"Google DeepMind,Developer tools","go_live_date_time":"2026-07-09|16:00","days_since_published":1,"content_category":null,"word_count":0,"summary":"Finding the most efficient algorithm — whether designing a microchip, routing a logistics network or accelerating medical research — can be…","full_url":"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/infrastructure-and-cloud/google-cloud/alphaevolve-on-cloud/","url":"/innovation-and-ai/infrastructure-and-cloud/google-cloud/alphaevolve-on-cloud/","published":"2026-07-09T16:00:00Z","hero":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/1-Blog_hero_pic.max-300x300.format-webp.webp","main_hero_image":null,"category":"short-post","tag":"google-cloud","tag_eyebrow":"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/infrastructure-and-cloud/google-cloud/","tag_name":"Google Cloud","eyebrow":"<time class=\"uni-timesince\" datetime=\"2026-07-09 16:00:00+00:00\" aria-label=\"July 09\">Jul 09</time> / Google Cloud","show_byline":null,"sitespace":"","sitespace_render":"","published_node":"<time class=\"uni-timesince\" datetime=\"2026-07-09 16:00:00+00:00\">Jul 09</time>","published_readable_date":"Jul 09","body_text":"<div class=\"rich-text\"><p data-block-key=\"ctnyf\">Finding the most efficient algorithm — whether designing a microchip, routing a logistics network or accelerating medical research — can be challenging, with many possible solutions for engineers to explore on their own.</p><p data-block-key=\"94n8f\">To help organizations tackle these complex challenges, AlphaEvolve, our Gemini-powered AI code-optimization agent, is now generally available to all Google Cloud customers on Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform.</p><p data-block-key=\"um9s\">Rather than rewriting code from scratch, AlphaEvolve acts as an evolutionary collaborator: you provide a baseline algorithm and your goals, and it automatically searches for better solutions, returning human-readable, optimized code.</p><p data-block-key=\"788rs\">Since launching in private preview last December, we've seen strong results from our early adopters. BASF, JetBrains and Kinaxis and many more have solved previously intractable business and research problems with AlphaEvolve.</p><p data-block-key=\"703b2\">For more details and step-by-step guides, head to the <a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/ai-machine-learning/alphaevolve-is-available-for-everyone\">Google Cloud announcement</a>.</p></div>","short_body":[{"type":"perspective_qa","value":{"article":null,"external_url":"https://cloud.google.com/blog/products/ai-machine-learning/alphaevolve-is-available-for-everyone","eyebrow_override":"","title_override":"Solve harder problems with AlphaEvolve, now available to everyone on Google Cloud","hide_image":false,"image":{"id":68605,"renditions":{"medium":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/1-Blog_hero_pic.max-300x300.format-webp.webp","full_url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/1-Blog_hero_pic.max-300x300.format-webp.webp","width":300,"height":168,"alt":"AlphaEvolve on Google Cloud"},"medium_retina":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/1-Blog_hero_pic.max-600x600.format-webp.webp","full_